{"login": "shasankp000", "location": "India", "commits": [{"sha": "acbf923b6e3c4650f3e3a8d36b8dd2890eaa3502", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2023-10-12T06:43:47Z", "repo": "FunwithMctext-v1.1-alpha", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eb2f684bb02c19c72f2fdc747587dbb2dd38df1d", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2020-08-23T11:57:38Z", "repo": "FunwithMctext-v1.1-alpha", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9af621adf09f474155a9caad215a74cce0864740", "message": "Add files via upload\n\n# Fun with Mctext \r\n# Release 1.1 alpha\r\n# Original Author : shasankp000 (www.github.com/shasankp000)\r\n# This is a game which is minecraft, but entirely a text based, choice selection based game.\r\n# Messages similar to minecraft text console , which makes the player feel familiar to minecraft(if they have played it before)\r\n# Current features include: \r\n> the command block(includes the console, and some commands of the minecraft console)\r\n> the redstone torch(available, but not implemented in inventory or usage yet)\r\n> the redstone dust(available and can be used)\r\n> the redstone repeater(available and can be used)\r\n> the lever (available and can be used)\r\n> the console commands are based on the 1.16.2 minecraft version. (very recent one. i always keep updated with the versions.)\r\n## Currently the command block operates on its default power source , that is a button placed near it. The redstone power feature will be added in the next update. ##\r\n## Fixed the unwanted game pause with no input recognition after some choices. Now game will ask the player what the player wants to do next after each action ##\r\n## The default gamemode is set to Creative mode. The gamemode change options with other gamemodes will be added in the next update ##\r\n## A new debugger will be added to debug buggy codes ##\r\n## A new feature will be added so that the player can input custom commands (works only on the custom created command blocks, not the game defined ones.)\r\n\r\nHave Fun :D \r\n\r\nIf you want to collaborate , contact my instagram account @steve._2004 .\r\n\r\nPlease support the project, i started this as a source of entertainment in these boring and stressful times, and want to share my creation with the world so that they can be happy too :D \r\n\r\nThanks again, \r\n#Stay home , stay safe.", "created_at": "2020-08-23T11:55:45Z", "repo": "FunwithMctext-v1.1-alpha", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "71b6ef7888736cc73a8d2360839c29aebec7b51b", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2020-08-23T11:53:13Z", "repo": "FunwithMctext-v1.1-alpha", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e530156a3fe70bfc4850353c6890c75f86c3b94a", "message": "Update affiliation to University of Manchester", "created_at": "2025-10-18T12:57:51Z", "repo": "shasankp000", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0673ba571f645d2cdcd85c344c3c39b19ee908c4", "message": "Add vision section to README\n\nAdded a vision section to clarify the project's goal of understanding humans through shared logic and emotion.", "created_at": "2025-10-05T15:48:37Z", "repo": "shasankp000", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e17e0e37a4dabd03c9acbfc4c629a88b6148ef1d", "message": "Revise skills and tools in README\n\nUpdated skills and tools section with new languages and AI/ML terms.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T18:58:48Z", "repo": "shasankp000", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a158f0c511cf5382ea612b4e76f1e21a0c97d2ef", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2025-08-24T06:22:53Z", "repo": "shasankp000", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5da1064a4257561a8e6cc371e3f2d83f948f8ae9", "message": "Revise README with p